graph TD
    subgraph Authoring_Service [Question Service - Mongo]
        UI[React Client] -->|PATCH/Save| API[Spring Boot]
        API -->|Save/Update| Mongo[(MongoDB)]
        API -->|Validate on Change| Lambda
    end

    subgraph Validation_Pipeline [Lambda Orchestrator]
        Lambda -->|Check Rules| Rules[Business Rules]
        Lambda -->|Transform| SQL_Format[SQL Normalization]
    end

    subgraph Assignment_Service [Monolith - SQL]
        SQL[(Main SQL DB)]
        Events[Event Listener]
    end

    Lambda -->|Sync Valid Data| SQL
    SQL -->|Assignment Created| Events
    Events -->|Lock Request| API
    API -->|Set status: locked| Mongo
    API -->|Block Updates| UI